# Scoped the same way .gitignore is: ignore everything, then add back only the
# hand-written sources. This keeps `prettier --write .` away from session
# transcripts, caches, downloads and installed plugin code.
/*

!/CLAUDE.md
!/scripts/
!/skills/
!/commands/

# settings.json stays out on purpose: Claude Code rewrites it with its own JSON
# layout, so formatting it would only trade edits back and forth with the CLI.
